sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant MC as Mission client
  participant FC as Flock coordinator :8083
  participant DET as SarSignificantEventDetector
  participant K as sar.telemetry.events
  participant SA as Safety analyst JAR
  participant K2 as sar.violation-assessments
  participant CP as SarCopilotRecorder

  Note over MC,CP: Drone SAR Phase 2.5 — green = HTTP A2A · purple = domain Kafka sidecar

  rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note right of FC: Control plane — standard HTTP JSON-RPC + SSE
    MC->>FC: GET agent-card
    FC-->>MC: AgentCard (pushNotifications: false)
    MC->>FC: SendMessage (start mission)
    FC-->>MC: Task submitted
    loop Mission ticks
      FC-->>MC: SSE statusUpdate / artifactUpdate
      MC->>DET: evaluate telemetry from stream
    end
  end

  rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
    Note right of K: Sidecar — NOT mirrored from A2A push
    DET-->>MC: GEOFENCE_VIOLATION / LOW_BATTERY / …
    MC->>K: produce SarTelemetryEvent
    K->>SA: consume (safety-analyst group)
    SA->>SA: template or Ollama assessment
    SA->>K2: produce SarViolationAssessment
    MC->>CP: record narration + assessment for replay
  end

  Note over MC,K2: No PushNotificationReceiver · no a2a.task.events<br/>Phase 2d AI coordinator does not add Part 8 wiring
